{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vba9fDwkziW8ZRp1YG1yki","type":"tool_result","content":"**Hosted checks and the resident Git memo.** `pose runtime run [--envelope] [--timeout <d>] <command> [args...]` runs `review-check`, `closeout-check`, `artifact-check`, `surface-check` or `roadmap-check` in the runtime of the worktree when one is running, compatible and willing, and standalone in this process otherwise; the exit code and the output are the command's, and `--envelope` prints one document (`pose.runtime.run/1`) with them and with `via` (`runtime` or `standalone`), the `fallback_reason`, the typed `outcome` (`completed`; `error` when the command ran and end\n approval. With `routing.rounds` `continue-thread` (the default) a round resumes the session the previous round ended with, through the agent's resume command; it opens a new session, recording why, when the agent or its vendor changes, the chain of drafts is broken, that session cannot be resumed, {+the previous round's checkout path is still there (a leftover or a live run),+} or the round reaches `routing.round_threshold` (5 by default), where `verify` also warns that the rounds are not converging. `cold-session` opens a new session every round. Each run records its `round` and `thread`; `pose insights` reports, per scope, findings per round, rounds to approval, and how prior findings were accounted for in continued and in cold rounds. A previous round whose record is not intact makes the\n**Checks hospedados e o memo residente do Git.** `pose runtime run [--envelope] [--timeout <d>] <comando> [args...]` roda `review-check`, `closeout-check`, `artifact-check`, `surface-check` ou `roadmap-check` no runtime do worktree quando há um rodando, compatível e disposto, e standalone neste processo caso contrário; o código de saída e a saída são os do comando, e `--envelope` imprime um documento (`pose.runtime.run/1`) com eles e com `via` (`runtime` ou `standalone`), o `fallback_reason`, o `outcome` tipado (`completed`; `error` quando o comando rodou e terminou ma\nuting.rounds` `continue-thread` (o padrão), uma rodada retoma a sessão com que a rodada anterior terminou, pelo comando de resume do agente; ela abre uma sessão nova, registrando o motivo, quando o agente ou seu vendor muda, a cadeia de drafts está quebrada, essa sessão não pode ser retomada, {+o caminho do checkout da rodada anterior ainda existe (uma sobra ou uma run viva),+} ou a rodada atinge `routing.round_threshold` (5 por padrão), onde o `verify` também avisa que as rodadas não estão convergindo. `cold-session` abre uma sessão nova a cada rodada. Cada run registra sua `round` e sua `thread`; `pose insights` reporta, por escopo, findings por rodada, rodadas até a aprovação, e como os findings anteriores foram contabilizados em rodadas continuadas e frias. Uma rodada anter\n pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/POSE.md               | 2 +-\n pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/POSE.md | 2 +-\n 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"81ece8ce-8f7d-48d5-97ca-08d4cbcc4488","timestamp":"2026-11-27T23:07:47.424Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"**Hosted checks and the resident Git memo.** `pose runtime run [--envelope] [--timeout <d>] <command> [args...]` runs `review-check`, `closeout-check`, `artifact-check`, `surface-check` or `roadmap-check` in the runtime of the worktree when one is running, compatible and willing, and standalone in this process otherwise; the exit code and the output are the command's, and `--envelope` prints one document (`pose.runtime.run/1`) with them and with `via` (`runtime` or `standalone`), the `fallback_reason`, the typed `outcome` (`completed`; `error` when the command ran and end\n approval. With `routing.rounds` `continue-thread` (the default) a round resumes the session the previous round ended with, through the agent's resume command; it opens